		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>70-foot-tall wooden form made of timbers, poles, shutters, and house parts.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 72, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam (near) +7 (2d10), <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 15</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Antimagic Aura</strong>. A near-sized cube centered on colossus that cancels hostile spells targeting anyone inside the aura.</p><p></p><p><strong>Colossus</strong>. Immune to damage from non-magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Flammable</strong>. Can be damaged by fire. Takes x2 damage from it.</p><p></p><p><strong>Manor Form</strong>. Can rearrange itself to be a small manor, house, or hunting lodge.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
